        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='9300' hidden-by-user='true' id='581' type-v2='text' w='29412' x='55662' y='12450'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>How to read this chart?</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Each bar represents a Country and they are organized from largest to smallest based on Total GMV (represented by the circles). The color of the bar corresponds to the SFTP Score Group, and the number displayed on the bar refers to the Country&apos;s SFTP Score.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Note: For a detailed explanation of the &apos;SFTP Score&apos; and how it is calculated, you can click on the icon located in the top right corner of this dashboard. </run>
