            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>How to read this table?</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Each row in this table represents a Vendor, and in the columns, you can see each of the metrics we are measuring for them. For a detailed explanation of each of these metrics, click on the icon located in the top right corner of this dashboard.</run>
